MindTheGapps integration for crDroid 16.0 / gaokun3

Original implementation: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/vahiru/gaokun-android/blob/909c813/scripts/crdroid-tree-fixes.py
Function: patch_gapps_conflicts

Required while vendor/gapps is included:
- Drop the duplicate libjni_latinimegoogle module and package entry; LatinIME
  already defines it in packages/inputmethods/LatinIME/java/Android.bp.
- Drop google.xml and its package entry; vendor/addons/config.mk already
  installs product/etc/sysconfig/google.xml. Both the module definition and
  the package entry must be removed to avoid duplicate install rules.

Reference-project policy (optional for compilation):
- Omit Google's SetupWizard to avoid a Google-network-dependent first boot.
  crDroid's LineageSetupWizard remains enabled.

This patch is unnecessary if MindTheGapps is not included in the build.

